repository-code: "https://github.com/thiswind/DMHI"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of DMHI, a deterministic manifold-harmonic
  imputation method for multivariate time series with block missingness.
  The deployed inference path (Embed -> intrinsic Compute -> inverse Project)
  carries no neural-network weights, which makes the method suitable for edge
  deployment. This repository provides the method package, the evaluation
  harness, baseline runners, and the per-cell configurations used in the
  accompanying paper (under review at the IEEE Internet of Things Journal).
keywords:
  - time series
  - imputation
  - missing data
  - manifold learning
  - graph signal processing
  - edge computing
